sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Backend as Backend Service
    participant External as External Dependency

    Client->>Backend: Request
    Backend->>External: Call external service
    External--xBackend: 5xx Error (e.g. 503)
    Backend-->>Backend: Wait (exponential backoff)
    Backend->>External: Retry call
    External--xBackend: 5xx Error (e.g. 503)
    Backend-->>Backend: Format Error Envelope
    Backend-->>Client: HTTP Response (Error Envelope)
